  <content>
  <section><title>Student Activity</title>
<para>Now that you have written equations from tables, it is time to write systems of equations from graphs.</para>
<para><emphasis>Part 1: Writing a System of Equations from a Given Graph
  </emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1 – 8, use the given graph:</para>
<figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b54289584768c0c3eff29af44751b7ab9f385f7a"/></media></figure><div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="8ab13415-f850-440b-9ac1-7f67c5120a0f" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0"><!--Q#1-->
